From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 04:17:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Adaequare Settings: one record per Business instead of per
 GSTIN

- Doctype named by a Business link (plus Business Name); Client ID, Secret,
  Access Token and OTP are now per business.
- gst_portal resolves the settings via GSTIN.business_id; clear errors when
  the GSTIN has no Business or the Business has no active settings.
- GSP details API reads the Business's record (adds gsp.settingsName).
- Patch adaequare_settings_by_business renames existing records to the
  Business ID of their GSTIN.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
